		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# @ty_kodes Video Structure Board\n\nStart from the videos that already worked.\n\nThen change the smallest useful part.\n\n**Video Type -> Copy Structure -> Swap Line**","x":-680,"y":-460,"width":480,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"type_before_now","type":"text","text":"## Type 1: Before / Now First\n\nVideos:\n[7597639142125735198](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7597639142125735198)\n[7598828315583073567](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7598828315583073567)\n\nStructure:\nbefore / now\n-> specific viewer\n-> dark marks\n-> product job\n-> proof\n-> stock / link line\n\nLines to reuse:\n- before / now\n- melanated people\n- dark stains after every pimple\n- if the link is there, it is in stock","x":-40,"y":-500,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"type_if_have","type":"text","text":"## Type 2: If You Have This\n\nVideos:\n[7581268088889396511](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7581268088889396511)\n[7591274665813773599](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7591274665813773599)\n[7488894337007357215](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7488894337007357215)\n[7520116936307461406](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7520116936307461406)\n\nStructure:\nIf you have [visible problem]\n-> name the fix\n-> explain why the old fix failed\n-> expand symptom / location\n-> product reveal\n-> proof\n-> link line\n\nLines to reuse:\n- If you have this, use tranexamic acid\n- If you got these chocolate drops\n- If you got that muffin top\n- If you have hip boobs, fix your gut\n- digestive health is probably trash","x":430,"y":-500,"width":430,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"type_wrong_idea","type":"text","text":"## Type 3: Call Out The Wrong Idea\n\nVideos:\n[7576878639132839198](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7576878639132839198)\n[7592806157530483998](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7592806157530483998)\n\nStructure:\noutside wrong claim\n-> blunt reaction\n-> correction\n-> how it works\n-> worse alternative\n-> product job\n-> proof / link line\n\nLines to reuse:\n- Please stop falling for the scam\n- What the hell is this?\n- before you say it is just product\n- scrubs can destroy or dry out skin","x":-40,"y":-160,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"type_body_area","type":"text","text":"## Type 4: Name The Body Areas\n\nVideos:\n[7571546743838412063](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7571546743838412063)\n[7578982456158719263](https://www.tiktok.com/@ty_kodes/video/7578982456158719263)\n\nStructure:\nbody-area list\n-> trigger\n-> how to use\n-> visual proof\n-> answer doubt early\n-> how it works\n-> frequency / link line\n\nLines to reuse:\n- chest acne, back acne, booty acne\n- especially ingrown hairs\n- spray it where you have spots and bumps","x":430,"y":-160,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"video_a","type":"file","file":"videos/7597639142125735198.mp4","x":1080,"y":-500,"width":240,"height":420},
		{"id":"breakdown_a","type":"text","text":"## Example A: TX Cream Before / Now First\n\nOriginal Line | Skeleton To Reuse\n---|---\nThis is 3 weeks ago. This is now. | This is [time] ago. This is now.\nThis was 2 weeks ago. And this is now. | This was [time] ago. And this is now.\nfor all of us melanated people | for all of us [viewer] people\nannoying dark stains after every pimple | [pain] after every [trigger]\ndark spot laser remover in a tube | [clear product metaphor] in a [format]\nthis TX cream is what I've been using | this [product] is what I've been using\nstops new ones from even coming in | stops [future problem] from even coming in\nI checked reviews | I checked [reviews / comments / proof]\nuneven to even | [before state] to [after state]\ncactus legs, rug burn face, 5 o'clock shadow | [specific use case 1], [specific use case 2], [specific use case 3]\nI waited 3 weeks to get this | I waited [time] to get this\nif the link is there, it is in stock | if the link is there, it is [available / in stock / on sale]\nIf you don't, sorry, I ran out. | If you don't see it, [stock/access reason]","x":1360,"y":-500,"width":740,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"video_b","type":"file","file":"videos/7581268088889396511.mp4","x":1080,"y":-40,"width":240,"height":420},
		{"id":"breakdown_b","type":"text","text":"## Example B: TX Cream If You Have This\n\nOriginal Line | Skeleton To Reuse\n---|---\nIf you have this... | If you have [visible problem]...\nuse tranexamic acid | use [ingredient / product type]\nrepeats the command 3 times | If you got this, use [fix]. Definitely.\nbecause it's horrible | because it's [emotional description]\nyou clear acne, but still look like acne | you fix [surface problem], but you still look like you have [problem]\ndark spots are left behind | all these [leftover marks / symptoms] are left behind\ntranexamic acid is made to clear up those dark spots | [ingredient] is made to help with [specific problem]\nass, face, wherever | whether it's on your [area 1], [area 2], wherever\nI've been gatekeeping this | I've been gatekeeping [this product / this fix] for [time]\npeople been asking me how my skin look clear | people keep asking me how my [result] looks like this\nThis secret right here. | This [secret / product / step] right here.\nlink is usually sold out | when I send people the link, it's usually [sold out / gone]\nif you see it down here... act fast | if you see it [down here / linked], that means [availability]\nact fast before they sell out again | act fast before [stock / sale] is gone again","x":1360,"y":-200,"width":740,"height":520,"color":"2"},
