		{"id":"lines_opening","type":"text","text":"## Openings\n\n- This is [time] ago. This is now.\n- If you have [problem], use [ingredient].\n- If you got [visible thing], fix [root problem].\n- If your [body / gut / skin] looks like this...\n- You're not [wrong label].\n- That's not [surface problem].\n- Stop using [wrong fix] for [problem].\n- If you got [area 1], [area 2], [area 3]...\n- Does [ingredient] bleach your skin?\n- Please stop falling for [wrong claim].","x":-60,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_pain","type":"text","text":"## Pain Lines\n\n- acne clears, but dark spots stay\n- skin goes clear, bad, clear again\n- acne keeps going away and coming back\n- dark spots on face / back / ass / body\n- body wash is not helping these marks\n- chest / back / booty acne leaves marks\n- ingrowns leave dark marks\n- underarm / inner thigh / butt marks\n- muffin top / love handles / morning skinny\n- bad bloating / bad farts / clogged up","x":280,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_audience","type":"text","text":"## Viewer Lines\n\n- melanated people\n- chocolate to medium tone people\n- people with darker skin marks\n- people with post-acne marks\n- people with body-area marks\n- people who shave / sweat / go to gym\n- people with chest, back, or booty acne\n- people with ingrowns after shaving\n- people whose acne keeps coming back\n- men with low energy or performance problems","x":620,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_wrong","type":"text","text":"## Wrong Ideas\n\n- you're just fat\n- it's genetics\n- it's just acne\n- skincare alone will fix it\n- this wipes off dark marks instantly\n- regular body wash should fix body marks\n- scrubbing harder fixes body acne marks\n- any toner works before dark-spot cream\n- glutathione bleaches your skin\n- probiotics are all the same","x":960,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_job","type":"text","text":"## Product Job\n\n- TX Cream = fade step\n- Serum Soap = daily shower cleanser step\n- TX Toner Pad = prep step\n- Peel Shot = exfoliation / buildup step\n- Mandelic Serum = body acne treatment step\n- Kojic / turmeric = tone support step\n- Probiotic = daily gut support\n- Digestive enzyme = digestion support\n- Shilajit / sea moss = energy support\n- Beef liver = nutrient support","x":1300,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_proof","type":"text","text":"## Proof\n\n- before / now\n- review proof\n- comment proof\n- texture / buildup demo\n- body-area use case\n- personal reversal\n- side-by-side receipt\n- ingredient reason\n- routine order\n- reply comment","x":1640,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"lines_link","type":"text","text":"## Link Lines\n\n- if the link is there, it is in stock\n- if you see it down here, act fast\n- I will leave it down below\n- check if it is still available\n- try this before you buy another [wrong product]\n- before you buy another [wrong fix]...\n- if it is still on sale, grab it\n- the exact one is linked\n- use it like this first\n- do not get the wrong one","x":1980,"y":1220,"width":300,"height":380,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"video_c","type":"file","file":"videos/7576878639132839198.mp4","x":1080,"y":420,"width":240,"height":420},
		{"id":"breakdown_c","type":"text","text":"## Example C: Peel Shot Scam Correction\n\nOriginal Line | Skeleton To Reuse\n---|---\nPlease stop falling for the scam | Please stop falling for [wrong claim / fake demo]\nrubbing eyeshadow on their legs | people doing [specific wrong behavior]\ndon't peel hyperpigmentation off | this does not [fake result]\nyou're gonna get scammed if you think... | you're gonna get scammed if you think [wrong expectation]\nwhat it actually does... | what it actually does is [real product job]\ncreates these peel shot balls | it creates [visible product action]\ngrabs anything stuck to it | it [grabs / lifts / clears] [thing it removes]\nwhiteheads, blackheads, dirt, sebum oils | whether it's [thing 1], [thing 2], [thing 3]\nthen it starts lightening up the skin | then after that, it helps [second benefit]\nkojic acid and turmeric | because it has [ingredient 1] and [ingredient 2]\nface, inner legs, underarms | use it on [area 1], [area 2], [area 3]\nmy chest used to look like chocolate drops | my [area] used to look like [visual pain]\nnow look at it | now look at [proof]\nselling out like crazy | it sells out every time I [try to get more / check stock]\nact fast before they sell out again | act fast before [stock / sale] is gone again","x":1360,"y":540,"width":740,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"skeleton_receipt","type":"text","text":"## Template 1: Receipt First\n\n1. This is [time] ago. This is now.\n2. This was [time] ago. And this is now.\n3. for all of us [viewer] people\n4. who get [pain] after every [trigger]\n5. this is [clear product metaphor] in a [format]\n6. this [product] is what I’ve been using for [specific problem]\n7. it helps [main benefit]\n8. and it stops [future problem] from even coming in\n9. I saw this / heard about this, so I checked [reviews / comments / proof]\n10. people are going from [before state] to [after state]\n11. if you have [specific use case 1], [specific use case 2], or [specific use case 3], this helps too\n12. I waited [time] to get this / I’ve been gatekeeping this for [time]\n13. if the link is there, it is [available / in stock / on sale]\n14. if you don’t see it, [stock / access reason]","x":2260,"y":-500,"width":820,"height":480,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skeleton_if_have","type":"text","text":"## Template 2: If You Have This\n\n1. If you have [visible problem]...\n2. use [ingredient / product type]\n3. If you got this, use [fix]. Definitely.\n4. because it’s [emotional description]\n5. when you fix [surface problem], but still look like you have [same problem]\n6. that is because [leftover issue] is still there\n7. [ingredient / product type] is made to help with [specific problem]\n8. whether it’s on your [area 1], [area 2], [area 3], wherever\n9. this [product / step] is what I’ve been using\n10. I’ve been gatekeeping [this product / this fix] for [time]\n11. people keep asking me how my [result] looks like this\n12. this [secret / product / step] right here\n13. when I send people the link, it’s usually [sold out / gone]\n14. if you see it [down here / linked], that means [availability]\n15. act fast before [stock / sale] is gone again","x":2260,"y":20,"width":820,"height":520,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"skeleton_correction","type":"text","text":"## Template 3: Correction First\n\n1. Please stop falling for [wrong claim / fake demo]\n2. people are doing [specific wrong behavior]\n3. this does not [fake result]\n4. that is not how [problem / product] works\n5. you’re gonna get scammed if you think [wrong expectation]\n6. what it actually does is [real product job]\n7. when you use it, it creates / does [visible product action]\n8. it [grabs / lifts / clears / preps] [thing it works on]\n9. whether it’s [thing 1], [thing 2], [thing 3], whatever it is\n10. then after that, it helps [second benefit]\n11. because it has [ingredient 1] and [ingredient 2]\n12. use it on [area 1], [area 2], [area 3], wherever you want to [desired result]\n13. my [area] used to look like [visual pain]\n14. now look at [proof]\n15. if you see it linked, act fast before [stock / sale] is gone again","x":2260,"y":580,"width":820,"height":520,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"soap_image","type":"file","file":"assets/dr_melaxin_serum_soap.jpeg","x":3200,"y":-500,"width":280,"height":280},
		{"id":"soap_inputs","type":"text","text":"## Dr.Melaxin Serum Soap Inputs\n\n### Visible Problems\n- dark spots from acne\n- hyperpigmentation\n- uneven skin tone\n- body marks\n- dull texture\n\n### Pain Lines\n- regular cleanser does not feel enough\n- body wash cleans you, but marks still stay\n- want deep clean without stripped skin\n- large body areas need a shower step\n- dark marks make skin look uneven after acne clears\n\n### Weird Product Feature\n- stretchy\n- gooey / slimy\n- pizza cheese texture\n- magnetic viscosity\n- sticky serum lather\n- takes a bit to rinse off\n- stays on skin more than liquid cleanser\n\n### Product Job\n- daily cleanser step\n- shower entry step\n- tone-care soap\n- kojic / turmeric cleanse step\n- first step before a fade step\n\n### Review Proof\n- deeply cleansed\n- super soft\n- smooth\n- no dryness\n- not stripped\n- residue free\n- orange / grapefruit / floral smell\n- thick bar, lasts long\n\n### Objections\n- strong smell\n- weird sticky texture\n- harder to rinse\n- big bar / messy / wasteful\n- pricey for soap\n- unsure about fading yet\n- use SPF if used on face","x":3500,"y":-500,"width":520,"height":780,"color":"4"}
